1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,591
Expiration is normally passive.

2
00:00:02,591 --> 00:00:12,421
The muscles relax, the elastic lungs and chest wall recoil, the volume falls, the pressure rises, and air is pushed out.

3
00:00:12,421 --> 00:00:18,346
Only forced breathing uses the internal intercostals and the abdominal muscles.

